{
  "name": "JMMS | Growth OS → HubSpot Orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HubSpot RevOps Public Orchestration Demo\n**Architecture:** n8n → GitHub Actions → deterministic Python dry run\n\n**Safe default:** `dry_run`\n\nBefore the first run:\n1. Publish `public-orchestrator.yml` on the default branch (`main`).\n2. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential named `GitHub Actions Token`.\n3. Use:\n   - Header: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer <fine-grained GitHub PAT>`\n4. Give the token access only to this repository with Actions permission.\n5. Select that credential in the GitHub HTTP Request nodes.\n\nRepository template:\n`YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/jmms-hubspot-revops`\n\nThe public orchestration path supports `dry_run` only and does not require a HubSpot credential.",
        "height": 430,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "da910a60-225e-4e5c-a280-0f091e54668f",
      "name": "SETUP — READ FIRST",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        528,
        -256
      ]
    },
